	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

Scenario: Update contact on account
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be updated while assigned to accounts.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact1                        |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry     | Automotive                               |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes        | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Sold By      | Liferay US                               |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I update a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact2                        |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact2                        |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

